OL,3,GNEWSABurnham's plan to end pension
OL,4,Atriple lock a bad idea, Swinney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister's plan to end the
OL,7,Ftriple lock on pensions is a "bad
OL,8,Fidea", First Minister John Swinney has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe policy ensures that state pensions
OL,12,Fincrease annually in line with
OL,13,Finflation, average wage growth, or 2.5%
OL,14,F- whichever is highest.
OL,16,FHowever, at the Labour conference, Andy
OL,17,FBurnham said that from April 2030 the
OL,18,Fannual earnings option would be
OL,19,Fdropped.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
