OL,3,GNEWSABurnham's plan to end pension
OL,4,Atriple lock a bad idea, Swinney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham also hit back at Swinney's
OL,7,Fclaim that he would be the UK's last
OL,8,Fprime minster, insisting he was
OL,9,F"determined" to prove the SNP leader
OL,10,Fwrong.
